---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import { BUSINESS, CARTA, IMAGES } from '../data/site';
---

<section id="carta" class="bg-base-200 border-base-300 relative overflow-hidden border-y py-20 sm:py-24">
	<div class="shelves pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-50" aria-hidden="true"></div>

	<div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
		<div class="flex flex-col gap-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between">
			<div>
				<p class="label text-secondary">— La carta</p>
				<h2
					class="font-display mt-3 text-4xl leading-[0.98] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] sm:text-5xl"
				>
					Lo que sale de<br />
					<span class="text-primary italic">la cocina</span>
				</h2>
			</div>
			<p class="text-base-content/60 max-w-xs text-sm leading-relaxed">
				Sin carta cerrada ni precios que envejezcan mal. Estas son las familias de la casa, de
				la primera hora al postre.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="bg-base-100 border-base-300 rounded-box mt-10 border p-6 shadow-[0_30px_60px_-50px_rgba(43,29,23,0.6)] sm:p-9">
			<div class="border-primary/30 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b pb-4">
				<p class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold">La Alacena</p>
				<p class="label text-base-content/40 text-[0.52rem]">Cocina casera · Onda</p>
			</div>

			<div class="mt-2 grid sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-x-10">
				{CARTA.map((plato) => (
					<article class="border-base-300 border-b py-5 last:border-b-0">
						<div class="flex items-baseline gap-3">
							<span class="label text-secondary text-[0.55rem]">{plato.number}</span>
							<h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold">{plato.title}</h3>
						</div>
						<p class="text-base-content/65 mt-1.5 pl-7 text-sm leading-relaxed">{plato.text}</p>
					</article>
				))}
			</div>

			<p class="label text-base-content/40 mt-5 text-[0.52rem] leading-relaxed">
				El menú y la disponibilidad cambian. Los precios se consultan en el local.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="bg-primary text-primary-content rounded-box mt-12 grid overflow-hidden lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr]">
			<div class="p-7 sm:p-10">
				<p class="label text-accent text-[0.58rem]">El menú del día</p>
				<h3
					class="font-display mt-3 text-4xl leading-[0.98] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] sm:text-5xl"
				>
					De lunes a viernes,<br />
					<span class="text-accent italic">como en casa</span>
				</h3>
				<p class="mt-5 max-w-lg text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/70">
					Un menú generoso, con varios platos para elegir y postre. La cocina cambia con el día
					y con lo que trae el mercado. El sábado se come de carta.
				</p>

				<ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm text-white/80">
					<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
						<i class="ri-checkbox-circle-fill text-accent mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"></i>
						Varios primeros y segundos para elegir
					</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
						<i class="ri-checkbox-circle-fill text-accent mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"></i>
						Postre casero incluido
					</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
						<i class="ri-checkbox-circle-fill text-accent mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"></i>
						Carnes a la brasa y platos de siempre
					</li>
				</ul>

				<p class="font-display mt-6 border-l-2 border-accent pl-4 text-base leading-snug text-white/65 italic">
					«Increíble menú diario y carnes a la brasa… Postres de verdad, un placer.»
					<span class="label mt-1 block text-[0.48rem] text-white/40 not-italic">
						— Reseña en TripAdvisor
					</span>
				</p>

				<div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
					<a
						href={BUSINESS.phoneHref}
						class="btn btn-accent btn-sm h-11 gap-2 rounded-full px-5 text-[0.7rem] font-semibold"
					>
						<i class="ri-phone-line text-base" aria-hidden="true"></i>
						Preguntar el menú
					</a>
					<span class="label text-[0.5rem] leading-relaxed text-white/40">
						Platos y precio, en el local
					</span>
				</div>
			</div>

			<figure class="relative min-h-[20rem] lg:min-h-full">
				<Image
					src={IMAGES.fotoVertical6}
					alt="Paella servida en la mesa de La Alacena"
					widths={[520, 820, 1100]}
					sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 44vw, 92vw"
					quality={82}
					loading="lazy"
					class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover"
				/>
				<div class="from-primary/40 pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
				<figcaption class="label absolute bottom-4 left-4 rounded-full bg-primary/85 px-3 py-2 text-[0.5rem] text-white/80">
					Arroces de la casa
				</figcaption>
			</figure>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
